    "title": "Roomba's bankruptcy could wreck more than just robot vacuums - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Clark ,\n7 days ago Roomba turned the humble vacuum into a status symbol of domestic automation, a puck-shaped promise that the future would quietly tidy the living room while people were at work. Its parent company, iRobot, is now in bankruptcy, and the fallout reaches far beyond one brand of robot vacuums, touching global supply chains, consumer trust in smart devices, and the fragile economics of hardware startups. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
